<title>PHILIPPINES: Victorias falls 37.8 pct on debt moratorium.</title>
<headline>Victorias falls 37.8 pct on debt moratorium.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Victorias Milling Co Inc fell 37.78 percent to 2.80 pesos in early trade on Friday on news that it had a debt problem and had secured a moratorium on loans amounting to 4.4 billion pesos ($167 million), brokers said.</p>
</text>
